WEBVTT

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:31.140
from national marathons
or from national events

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:33.210
to smaller regional races,

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:38.090
we've seen that people want
to run for a better future.

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:44.120
After all, peacemaking is not a sprint.

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:47.110
It is more of a marathon.

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:48.120
Thank you.

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:51.140
(Applause)